"<br>a keyframe, but keyframes need more space than other frames, so larger"
"<br>numbers here mean slightly smaller files but less precise seeking."
"<br>0 is equivalent to 1, which makes every frame a keyframe."
"<br>Values >= 300 are not recommended as the quality might be bad depending "
"upon decoder, encoder and luck."
"<br>For a strict MPEG-1/2/4 compliance this would have to be &lt;= 132."
